#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_res_config_settings__overdue_reminder_start_date
msgid ""
"Invoices due before this date are never reminded automatically. On a new "
"installation it is set to the day the module is installed, so that old "
"unpaid invoices are not chased by surprise. Leave it empty to remind every "
"unpaid invoice."
